{"summary":"Calm down and cut nice lawns","description":"Leave your worries behind and enter the calm, simple world of mowing. Love nature? Love mowing? Love the simple life? Find it all as your mower turns troublesome turf into backyard bliss. \n\nZone out and mow to your heart’s content, totally stress free. No penalties, no score, it’s literally just mowing. The perfect casual zen experience. From seedlings to great oaks, everyone can enjoy the mowing life.\n\n- Guide your mower around lush gardens and charming houses; leave no blade of grass un-trimmed.\n- Win new parts and get your mower looking real nice. There’s literally thousands of combinations.\n- Collect beautiful butterflies for your album.\n- Don’t forget to take care of those parks and sports fields. You may find something interesting hiding beneath.\n- Mow daily to earn extra rewards.\n\nIn this life, only three things matter: you, a nice, neat lawn, and the grass that stands between!\n\nIt’s Literally Just Mowing is free, but contains in game purchases. These can be disabled in your device settings.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $48.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N1WY_dJmwkE?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8cpBsXMENhwI2Yd5QE-CtIcCj-i1mP0gNKA2y0oVJJY02_Rfmg8Ng3EEsyrCaOwj0cySrtodP8uvJL6oOlU7xbk","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kwQUbKrUrMx_qPr9EgMuIkuGGhRFtf6pRW8WLyIzsgDSI0CyJjvydL1YPR5yqiDI6CZiOM_n3Rea-l0_qGwxzDU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g_4WK6ko7Tw-Q0uCx9QUgxNQJYb_Gg6IdGrbUD0rL5-QcJ_Uh1BS8W9pEIa9ZQJbd26fEoWDtYO9OSlO0w4nhg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNaSv2SIRuss6NLP_5NyC5N9ttg5PboB6-RS9JuRPJe89sx4SUYPl7VT6DBXpz0Usj33FOD8FPhL28m5yaw09w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Gm4bHhbxjH82Zbi-cQwdSYXuO381gepgtp-_hfCmgyL5zVuhKDNVHGst50spK_c0KLa0znybdxEOo03kdqEOyjE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CUVkN3-iujTPqr7BDy4s82OoQtXkKNnen8pSjUWJtgaO60A7C99v5I